[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 131 Don't",
    "start": 1.63,
    "end": 5.772,
    "zh": "第131课 别",
    "zh_hant": "第131課 別"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "be so sure!",
    "start": 5.422,
    "end": 6.852,
    "zh": "那么肯定！",
    "zh_hant": "那麼肯定！"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 7.833,
    "end": 11.415,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "What's the problem about deciding on a holiday?",
    "start": 13.636,
    "end": 17.398,
    "zh": "决定假期有什么问题？",
    "zh_hant": "決定假期有什麼問題？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Where are you going to spend your holidays this year, Gary?",
    "start": 19.799,
    "end": 22.941,
    "zh": "加里，今年你打算去哪儿度假？",
    "zh_hant": "加里，今年你打算去哪兒度假？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "We may go abroad.",
    "start": 24.241,
    "end": 25.762,
    "zh": "我们可能出国。",
    "zh_hant": "我們可能出國。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "I'm not sure.",
    "start": 25.922,
    "end": 27.083,
    "zh": "我不确定。",
    "zh_hant": "我不確定。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "My wife wants to go to Egypt.",
    "start": 27.423,
    "end": 29.904,
    "zh": "我妻子想去埃及。",
    "zh_hant": "我妻子想去埃及。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "I'd like to go there, too.",
    "start": 30.565,
    "end": 32.145,
    "zh": "我也想去那里。",
    "zh_hant": "我也想去那裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "We can't make up our minds.",
    "start": 32.806,
    "end": 34.847,
    "zh": "我们拿不定主意。",
    "zh_hant": "我們拿不定主意。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Will you travel by sea or by air?",
    "start": 36.147,
    "end": 38.849,
    "zh": "你们将乘船还是乘飞机旅行？",
    "zh_hant": "你們將乘船還是乘飛機旅行？"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "We may travel by sea.",
    "start": 39.689,
    "end": 41.51,
    "zh": "我们可能乘船旅行。",
    "zh_hant": "我們可能乘船旅行。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "It's cheaper, isn't it?",
    "start": 42.431,
    "end": 45.532,
    "zh": "那更便宜，不是吗？",
    "zh_hant": "那更便宜，不是嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "may be cheaper, but it takes a long time.",
    "start": 45.182,
    "end": 48.294,
    "zh": "可能更便宜，但很费时间。",
    "zh_hant": "可能更便宜，但很費時間。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "I'm sure you'll enjoy yourselves.",
    "start": 49.635,
    "end": 51.936,
    "zh": "我相信你们会玩得很开心。",
    "zh_hant": "我相信你們會玩得很開心。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Don't be so sure.",
    "start": 52.896,
    "end": 54.697,
    "zh": "别那么肯定。",
    "zh_hant": "別那麼肯定。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "We might not go anywhere.",
    "start": 55.038,
    "end": 57.138,
    "zh": "我们可能哪儿也不去。",
    "zh_hant": "我們可能哪兒也不去。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "My wife always worries too much.",
    "start": 57.699,
    "end": 60.7,
    "zh": "我妻子总是担心太多。",
    "zh_hant": "我妻子總是擔心太多。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Who's going to look after the dog?",
    "start": 61.421,
    "end": 64.042,
    "zh": "谁来照看狗？",
    "zh_hant": "誰來照看狗？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Who's going to look after the house?",
    "start": 64.303,
    "end": 66.984,
    "zh": "谁来照看房子？",
    "zh_hant": "誰來照看房子？"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Who's going to look after the garden?",
    "start": 67.244,
    "end": 69.945,
    "zh": "谁来照看花园？",
    "zh_hant": "誰來照看花園？"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "We have this problem every year.",
    "start": 70.366,
    "end": 73.287,
    "zh": "我们每年都有这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "我們每年都有這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "In the end, we stay at home",
    "start": 73.728,
    "end": 76.229,
    "zh": "最后，我们待在家里",
    "zh_hant": "最後，我們待在家裡"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "and look after everything!",
    "start": 76.169,
    "end": 78.23,
    "zh": "照看一切！",
    "zh_hant": "照看一切！"
  }
]
